(x) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a person in the service of a foreign power with whom the Union is at peace and who is believed to be acting or to have acted in a manner prejudicial to the defence of the Union;

(y) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a person in the service of a foreign power with whom the Union is at peace and who is believed to be acting or to have acted in a manner prejudicial to the security of the Union;

(z) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a person in the service of a foreign power with whom the Union is at peace and who is believed to be acting or to have acted in a manner prejudicial to the interests of the Union in any place outside India;

(za) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a person in the service of a foreign power with whom the Union is at peace and who is believed to be acting or to have acted in a manner prejudicial to the safety of the Union in any place outside India;

(zb) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a person in the service of a foreign power with whom the Union is at peace and who is believed to be acting or to have acted in a manner prejudicial to the defence of the Union in any place outside India;

(zc) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a person in the service of a foreign power with whom the Union is at peace and who is believed to be acting or to have acted in a manner prejudicial to the security of the Union in any place outside India;

(zd) being a person subject to this Act, knowingly harbours or protects any person whom he knows or has reason to believe to be a spy;

